    {
      "text": "桌面母亲角色会跟随鼠标注视，并支持拖动、缩放与双屏切换",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The character's gaze will follow the movement of your mouse. -Supports character dragging (left mouse button) and zooming in and out (using the mouse wheel during dragging), but please do not block mother from watching TV. -You can switch the screen where the character is located in a dual-screen situation",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3399950/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "从游戏内母亲处学习日语、英美英语、粤语、闽南语等多种语言",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "You will learn dozen of languages from your mother-in-game: Japanese, British English, American English, Cantonese, Minnan, Northeastern, Shanghainese and more.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3399950/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "每次打开游戏都有机会遇到特殊母亲，例如日本黑道母亲",
      "dimension": "题材",
      "excerpt": "When you open the game, there is a chance that a mysterious mother will appear, such as a Japanese Yakuza mother.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3399950/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
